_rd_wg=PJP8C&amp;pd_rd_i=1975321847&amp;psc=1\" target=\"_blank\">Torture Princess: Fremd Torturchen, Vol. 7 (light novel) (Torture Princess: Fremd Torturchen (light novel), 7): Ayasato, Keishi: 9781975321840: Amazon.com: Books</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-12T17:57:06-08:00","id":1476299,"title":"","content":"Because I am a huge fan of the series and it was a major source of inspiration for my ideas on Asian American/Asian European Changelings, I want to put up this trailer for the second season of <b><i>The Ancient Magis Bride</i></b>, hoping people will watch it.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5iHv2ha1wOA\" target=\"_blank\">The Ancient Magus Bride Season 2 Trailer (2021) | Release Date, Cast, Episode 1, Ending, English Sub - YouTube</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-13T16:00:28-07:00","id":1476344,"title":"","content":"There is an anime/manga series that I have been following though it has not been released in the US. The basic premise is that there is a detective agency that resolves supernatural cases. Officially, the organization removes supernatural problems, threats from people's homes and communities, its actual goal is to bring about an understanding between humans and Yokai as the detectives, themselves are all Yokai. The main character is Kabane Kusaka, whom is half human and half-ghoul (A western demon).<br /> <br /> You can watch the first two episodes on youtube, sense Japan Top10 is promoting the series.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LZPkFAv2sTg\" target=\"_blank\">Kemono Jihen - Episode 1 [English Sub] HD - YouTube</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-13T16:01:55-07:00","id":1476345,"title":"","content":"You can also find out more about the series here:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://kemonojihen.fandom.com/wiki/Kemono_Jihen_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\">Kemono Jihen Wiki | Fandom</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-14T17:40:50-07:00","id":1476404,"title":"","content":"Being a HUGE FAN of the <b><i>Journey to the West</i></b> work of literature, IF an Asian Changeling the Lost rule book comes out I would love to see a court based on the lore. As such, I have been looking for interesting modern takes on the lore, One movie that caught my eye is <b><i>Immortal Demon Slayer. </i></b><br /> <br /> Forget everything you know about Journey to the West novel cause Wu Kong here is a complete rewrite the origin of Sun Wukong the number one Chinese folk heroes with a much more darker tone and it surprise the hell out of me.The CGI fight is very good,the characters is likable and the dark elements really shine when it bring actual emotion to the audience.i'm not sure is it the best movie about Sun Wukong but at the meantime it the most interesting one<br /> <br /> You can buy or rent the movie here:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Immortal-Demon-Slayer-Eddie-Peng/dp/B079JRXCK3\" target=\"_blank\">Watch Immortal Demon Slayer | Prime Video (amazon.com)</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-15T19:37:23-07:00","id":1476489,"title":"","content":"While on youtube, I found a Chinese movie about the Kitchen Fairy, Guo Wandie, falling in love with a young cook, Jiang Cong. It is being hosted by the Moxi Romance Movie Channel.<br /> <br /> <b><i>My GirlFriend is a Fairy:</i></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d-8NKDaJpoI\" target=\"_blank\">New Movie | My Girlfriend is a Fairy | Fantasy Love Story film, Full Movie HD - YouTube</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-15T19:47:25-07:00","id":1476490,"title":"","content":"I am embarrassed it took me so long to learn about this series, since I watched the original series religiously as a child in Thailand. <b><i>The New Legends of Monkey</i></b> is a reboot of the popular Japanese <b><i>Monkey </i></b>from the 70s and 80s. In this series, the Monkey King, escorts a monk with his allies to find lost scrolls of wisdom to free humanity from the yoke of demons.<br /> <br /> It has two seasons which you can buy or rent on amazon here:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/The-New-Legends-of-Monkey/dp/B09GTMBHT4\" target=\"_blank\">Watch The New Legends of Monkey | Prime Video (amazon.com)</a><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11066-madhatter","name":"Madhatter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"746"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}